{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>And you shall dress them</b> — two times in the Masorah here, and the other: <b>and you shall dress Elazar</b> (Numbers 20:28). Thus it teaches: a High Priest who is the son of a High Priest requires anointing, and this is <b>and you shall dress Elazar</b>, who was appointed to be High Priest — he requires anointing. Just as <b>and you shall dress them in tunics</b> was with anointing, for then they were drawn (anointed) thus, so too <b>and you shall dress Elazar</b> with anointing."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:39.090470033Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}